WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:04.350
Getting funded with Lamp. Part four: messages.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.270
On your account page, Messages is a conversation with your Lamp rep.

3
00:00:09.710 --> 00:00:14.020
Ask anything about your file here. Your rep's answers show up in the same place.

4
00:00:14.550 --> 00:00:16.800
Type your question at the bottom, and press Send.

5
00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:30.890
To send a statement or another document, use What we need, further down the page. It shows up in this conversation too.

6
00:00:31.250 --> 00:00:36.340
If your rep answers and you don't see it, Lamp emails you that a message is waiting.

7
00:00:36.770 --> 00:00:40.400
Have a question about an offer? Ask here, before you accept.

8
00:00:40.890 --> 00:00:43.900
Your rep is one message away.
